id=dt2w_fix_opd2404
name=DT2W Fix (caramel / OPD2404)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=AntiGem
description=Fixes double-tap-to-wake on OnePlus OPD2404 with the caramel kernel. The stock kernel never creates /proc/tp_gesture and its dt2w_daemon uses the wrong ioctl mode (14 instead of 24). This module patches lct_tp.ko to init the gesture node and keeps DT2W armed.
